From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Polack <spolack+git@mailbox.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:25:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] esp32-pixelcast: diagnostics log in storage sector 3

For when WLED is not reachable and its serial port cannot be watched:
the ESP-IDF log (Ethernet driver), network events and status snapshots
go to sector 3 of esp32-pixelcast's storage partition at 15, 45, 120
and 280 s and before switching back. esp32-pixelcast shows the log
(GET /api/wled-log).
---
 wled00/fcn_declare.h |   1 +
 wled00/pixelcast.cpp | 104 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 wled00/wled.cpp      |   1 +
 3 files changed, 106 insertions(+)

diff --git a/wled00/fcn_declare.h b/wled00/fcn_declare.h
index a09c00d7..8eff4aa7 100644
--- a/wled00/fcn_declare.h
+++ b/wled00/fcn_declare.h
@@ -625,6 +625,7 @@ void XML_response(Print& dest);
 void getSettingsJS(byte subPage, Print& dest);
 
 //pixelcast.cpp (esp32-pixelcast in the other app slot)
